+---
+id: task-001-fix-sku-case-free-shipping-threshold-line-vat-rounding
+type: task
+title: "Fix SKU case, free shipping threshold, line VAT rounding"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+Three reports, each a deviation from the README rules, fixed test-first (all three were red first).
+
+1. Lower-case SKU refused: `Catalog.find` only trimmed; it now uses `canonicalSku` (trim + upper case).
+2. Free shipping at exactly €50.00: `shippingCost` used `>`; the rule is "€50.00 or more", now `>=`.
+3. Line VAT one cent low: `lineVat` rounded down; it now uses `percentOf` (half up), e.g. 199 at 22% = 44.
+
+Tests: `test/catalog.test.ts` (lower-case lookup), new `test/rules.test.ts` (shipping threshold, VAT rounding).
